<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="page">
  <h1>Pricing &amp; Billing</h1>
  <p class="lead">All prices are in Thai Baht (THB) and exclude VAT/sales tax, which Lemon Squeezy calculates at checkout based on the buyer's country. Pay by credit/debit card or PayPal.</p>

  <div class="plans single">
    <div class="plan featured">
      <div class="pname">Pay as you go</div>
      <div class="pprice">฿0 / month + usage</div>
      <div class="punit muted">No setup fee, no minimum, no contract. At the start of each month you receive an invoice for the records actually processed in the previous month, payable via Lemon Squeezy.</div>
      <ul>
        <li>All modes of the software (reports / document downloads / submissions)</li>
        <li>Unlimited installs under one operator name</li>
        <li>Real-time usage and invoice history in the customer portal</li>
        <li>Free updates and email support within 1 business day</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn primary">Open an account</a>
      <p class="muted small">Opening an account is free — nothing is charged until you actually use the software. Already have an account? <a href="/portal/login">Customer login</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Unit price per task type</h2>
  <p class="muted">Used to calculate your monthly invoice · 1 record = 1 application / 1 document / 1 worker processed successfully</p>
  <table class="prices">
    <thead><tr><th>Task type</th><th>Group</th><th class="r">Price / record</th><th class="r">Price / run</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    <% for (const p of prices) { %>
      <tr><td><%= p.mode_label || p.mode %></td><td><span class="tag g-<%= p.mode_group || '' %>"><%= GROUP_LABELS[p.mode_group] || '' %></span></td>
        <td class="r">฿<%= fmtMoney(p.price_per_record) %></td><td class="r"><%= Number(p.price_per_run) ? '฿' + fmtMoney(p.price_per_run) : '—' %></td></tr>
    <% } %>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>How billing works</h2>
  <ul class="bullets">
    <li><b>Free account</b> — no charge until you start using the software; no card on file.</li>
    <li><b>Invoice on the 1st of every month</b> — records processed in the previous month × unit price, visible in the customer portal.</li>
    <li><b>Pay within 15 days</b> via the Lemon Squeezy payment link in the portal (card or PayPal). The receipt is emailed immediately and can carry your company name, address and tax ID.</li>
    <li>Months with usage below ฿17 are carried forward to the next invoice (payment-provider minimum).</li>
    <li>You can verify usage before paying: the portal lists every job, and you can request a monthly report at <% if (co.COMPANY_EMAIL) { %><a href="mailto:<%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %>"><%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %></a><% } else { %>our support email<% } %>.</li>
    <li>Jobs cancelled or interrupted midway are billed only for the records completed before stopping.</li>
    <li>No contract — stop using the software and there is no further invoice. See the <a href="/refund">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a>.</li>
    <li>Price changes are announced by email at least 30 days in advance.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
